826 |    * @notice Custom view function to return the quantity burned by
827 |    *         an address w/n a given epoch.
828 |    *
829 |    * @param epoch The epoch we want to query
830 |    * @param user  The user we want to know the burned quantity
831 |    *              of cash tokens for in a given epoch
832 |    */
833 |   function getBurnedQuantity(
834 |     uint256 epoch,
835 |     address user
836 |   ) external view returns (uint256) {
